OL,3,GNEWSANew plans for second electricity
OL,4,Acable considered
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second electricity cable into
OL,7,FGuernsey via Jersey is being considered
OL,8,Fin a bid to meet rising demands on the
OL,9,Fisland, a company has said.
OL,11,FGuernsey currently gets about 90% of
OL,12,Fits electricity from mainland Europe
OL,13,Fvia an underwater interconnector cable.
OL,15,FA project to investigate a second cable
OL,16,Fdirectly from France - as well as other
OL,17,Foptions - was approved by the States in
OL,18,F2023.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
