OL,3,GNEWSANew plans for second electricity
OL,4,Acable considered
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey Electricity has now said it is
OL,7,Freviewing the possibility of a second
OL,8,Fconnection via Jersey, its annual
OL,9,Freport showed.
